  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Our</strong>&nbsp;<strong>Brand:</strong> Fraise makes elevated studio staples for pilates, barre, and yoga. We created the first grip sock that's naturally bacteria resistant, so you can sweat without worrying about odors or bacterial growth. With an emphasis on quality first, all of our products are OEKO-TEX&reg; certified, which means our materials have been rigorously tested and are free of toxic chemicals.<br><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; <strong>Our Products:</strong> We offer grip socks in a variety of timeless colorways. Their key benefits:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Antimicrobial</strong>: Silver has been used for thousands of years as an antimicrobial agent, known for its ability to fight over 600+ types of bacteria. When bound to our fabrics, silver ions eliminate odors and bacteria from the sweat on your feet, allowing you to wear your socks for long periods without worrying about stinky feet or athlete's foot.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Compression:</strong> Compression socks help circulation and reduce swelling in the legs and ankles by gently squeezing the legs. Our socks feature light compression in both the ankle and arch to help support your movement.<br><br><strong>Comfort:</strong> We&rsquo;ve added extra cushioning to the footbed for comfort and all day wear</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Proprietary Non-Slip Grip: O</strong>ur grips are larger than average to help provide more traction, which is perfect for beginners or those working with heavier weights.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Impact:</strong> For every pair purchased, we donate a pair of socks to local women's shelters to support those in need in our community. Socks are one of the most requested items in shelters, and ours can be especially useful since they're antimicrobial!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; <strong>Payment terms:</strong> For each purchase, you will receive a 15% commission on the sale price. We offer payment every other Friday via bank transfer, Venmo, and Paypal.<br><br><strong>&bull; General content creation guidelines: </strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">- General aesthetic: cohesive colored outfit pairings, &ldquo;clean girl aesthetic,&rdquo; wellness focused, elevated look and feel</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">- We love to see full outfits, not just your feet!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">- You don&rsquo;t need to be on a pilates mat or machine - athleisure &amp; lifestyle photos are welcome!&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;<br>- Have fun with it! We want your content to be authentic to you :)&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong></strong></p>\r\n</div>",
